# fixture make.local, sourced from make.conf. Real portage machines often
# use this pattern (see /etc/make.local on the machine portuale was
# developed on). Exercises "source" resolving an absolute path relative to
# PORTAGE_CONFIGROOT (chroot-style), and ${USE} substitution seeing the
# profile chain's accumulated value even though it's sourced from a
# different file than where USE was last set.
USE="${USE} localflag"
